  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "humidification; adding moisture to the air",
      "explanation": "Raising the moisture level of the air, typically to counter dryness in winter or in heated, air-conditioned rooms. Takes する to become a verb."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29748_kashitsu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加湿|かしつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "Humidify the room.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29748_kashitsu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{冬|ふゆ}→冬：00623_fuyu⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{加湿|かしつ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{大切|たいせつ}→大切：01456_taisetsu⟧だ。",
      "english": "Humidification is important in winter.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29748_kashitsu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{乾燥|かんそう}→乾燥：00184_kansou⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧⟦{季節|きせつ}→季節：01304_kisetsu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧、⟦{加湿器|かしつき}→加湿器：06491_kashitsuki⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加湿|かしつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧よい。",
      "english": "In the dry season, it is good to humidify the room with a humidifier.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "⟦{加|くわ}える→加える：01941_kuwaeru⟧ (to add) + {湿|しめ}り (moisture). Raising the humidity of a space, usually for comfort and health in dry conditions.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{加湿器|かしつき}→加湿器：06491_kashitsuki⟧: humidifier\n- {加湿|かしつ}⟦{機能|きのう}→機能：13165_kinou⟧: humidifying function\n- ⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加湿|かしつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to humidify a room\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{除湿|じょしつ}→除湿：09623_joshitsu⟧: dehumidification — the opposite; removing moisture from the air",
